  "notes": "College of Arts and Sciences B.S. in Biology (bulletin 2026-2027). Biology major = 30 cr (18 cr at 300-499 level, 18 cr at IUB): BIOL-L 111, L 112, L 113, L 211 (Molecular Biology), L 311 (Genetics), L 318 (Evolution), plus three advanced lectures from the approved list. Supporting: CHEM-C 117/C 127, CHEM-C 341/C 342/C 343 (Organic Chemistry); PHYS-P 201/P 202 (General Physics I & II); MATH-M 118 or higher. Students complete CASE College and IU Common Ground requirements. Major GPA 2.0 or higher. Prereqs: BIOL-L 211 requires L 112 and CHEM-C 117; BIOL-L 311 requires L/S 211; BIOL-L 318 requires L 111 and L/S 211.",
